However, I have one small problem. I want to reassign double underscore ("__") to "<-" instead of the default setting of one underscore. I managed to switch off the default settings as written in the guide, but I just could not make my new key binding work. I tried let vimrplugin_assign_map = "__" in my vimrc, but no success. (I use gVim 7.3) Thanks a lot!

